  "premise_review": [
    "Keep {C : Type u}, Category.{v} C, universe w, supplied T : Pretopology.{u,v,w} C and arbitrary Base : ∀ U, Cover C U → Prop exactly.",
    "The base constructor admits any S satisfying Base U S. The relation itself has no hbase requirement; membership in T.IsCover is established only by the later conditional minimality theorem.",
    "The identity constructor uses exactly Cover.identityCover U. The pullback constructor requires a supplied morphism f : V ⟶ U and an explicit p : T.PullbackData S f in addition to generated membership of S.",
