    "generated_minimal retains hbase : ∀ U S, Base U S → T.IsCover S. Its exact induction proof uses hbase and the supplied T.identityCovering, T.pullbackStable and T.transitiveCovering laws; it does not construct those laws.",
    "No sieve-based Grothendieck topology, concrete site, sheafification/descent theorem or unconditional generated-family covering theorem is supplied by this source.",
    "All6 top-level commands, four constructor types, universe/category parameters, variable context, theorem signatures and complete proof bytes remain exact copies; only containing namespaces, explicit lookup scaffolding and same-version component imports change."
